  unitName: Wizard Merlin (EU)
  unitId: 760165
  unitNumber: 7125
  description: "The figure who has been recorded being present at many historical
    events\u2026 He seems to be human, a grey old man. Is it really possible that
    a simple human can manage to conquer time? This man often is depicted next to
    powerful figures in history, right by their side... Could he have been whispering
    in their ears? How could a simple human be present in such important events throughout
    history? Nothing is known about him, only rumors and legends. However\u2026 there
    is someone in present day who matches the figure's description. A man who used
    to advise a good king during his reign over a beautiful kingdom. After his king
    died, the old man decided to live in a small cottage in the kingdom\xB4s capitol.
    It is rumored that he befriended a young squire, helping him with his knight
    training. Could he be the same man from the legends?"
  summonDesc: Are there any strings on you?
  fusionDesc: "Dance, little puppets\u2026"
  evoDesc: Are there any strings on you?
